      "id": 1,
      "text": "Cabool was christened in 1882 after Kabul, Afghanistan, using an older English spelling of the name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cabool%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A railroad engineer who had worked in Afghanistan noted the Texas County hills resembled Kabul, sparking the town’s name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
