        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://cabool.org/discover-the-history-and-natural-beauty-of-cabool-missouri/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cabool High School’s oldest buildings, erected in 1932, include a Works Progress Administration project.",
